{"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"],"title":"Guides","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Navigate between interactive elements using the keyboard."}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit provides a focus system that lets users move between interactive views (buttons, menus, text fields) using Tab, Shift+Tab, or arrow keys. The system consists of three parts:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Tracks which element is focused, handles navigation"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Protocol that views adopt to receive focus"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Lightweight state object that views use to query and request focus"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"How-Focus-Works","text":"How Focus Works","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every frame, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"},{"type":"text","text":" is cleared and interactive views re-register themselves during rendering. This means focus registrations are always in sync with the current view tree: removed views are automatically unregistered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The focus order follows the rendering order: the first focusable view rendered is first in the Tab cycle.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"The-Focusable-Protocol","text":"The Focusable Protocol","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Views that want to receive focus conform to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["public protocol Focusable: AnyObject {","    var focusID: String { get }","    var canBeFocused: Bool { get }","    func onFocusReceived()","    func onFocusLost()","    func handleKeyEvent(_ event: KeyEvent) -> Bool","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"focusID"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Unique identifier for this focusable element","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"canBeFocused"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Whether focus can move to this element (default: "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onFocusReceived()"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Called when this element gains focus (default: no-op)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onFocusLost()"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Called when this element loses focus (default: no-op)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Handle a key event while focused; return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" if consumed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A default extension provides sensible defaults for ","type":"text"},{"code":"canBeFocused","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), ","type":"text"},{"code":"onFocusReceived()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"onFocusLost()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (both no-ops). Only ","type":"text"},{"code":"focusID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must be implemented.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Using-FocusState","text":"Using FocusState","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState"},{"type":"text","text":" is the user-facing API for checking and requesting focus inside a view:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let focusState = FocusState(id: \"my-button\", focusManager: context.environment.focusManager)","","\/\/ Check if this element is currently focused","if focusState.isFocused {","    \/\/ render with focus indicator","}","","\/\/ Programmatically request focus","focusState.requestFocus()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Built-in views like ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Button","type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Menu","type":"reference"},{"text":" create their own ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" internally: you only need it when building custom focusable views.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Navigation-Keys","text":"Navigation Keys","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"},{"type":"text","text":" responds to these keys during dispatch:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Action","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the next element"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift+Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the previous element"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow Down \/ Right"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the next element"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow Up \/ Left"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the previous element"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"anchor":"FocusRegistration-Helper","text":"FocusRegistration Helper","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Built-in interactive views use the internal ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusRegistration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" helper to avoid boilerplate. It handles three tasks in one call:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Persist a focus ID","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" via "},{"code":"StateStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so it remains stable across renders"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Register","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the handler with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Query"}]},{"type":"text","text":" whether this view currently has focus"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Custom views that implement ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" typically do not need ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusRegistration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly. It is used by the framework’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"_*Core","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" views (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"_ButtonCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"_ListCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Focus-Indicator","text":"Focus Indicator","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The visual indicator depends on the view type. Buttons and similar controls use a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"highlight background bar","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for the focused item. Text fields use ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"pulsing vertical bars"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (caps) around the input area. Lists and tables use a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"highlight background","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for the focused row, with a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"pulsing accent background","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" when the row is both focused and selected.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Focus-in-the-Event-Loop","text":"Focus in the Event Loop","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Focus dispatch happens in Layer 2 of the key event pipeline (see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppLifecycle"},{"type":"text","text":"):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A key event arrives from stdin","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 1 (status bar) gets first chance to handle it"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 2: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeyEventDispatcher"},{"type":"text","text":" dispatches to the focused view’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If not consumed, navigation keys (Tab, arrows) are handled by ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusManager","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 3 (default bindings) handles quit, theme cycling, etc."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/focussystem"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"title":"Focus System","role":"article"},"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/PaletteReference":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A visual reference for all built-in color palettes with their exact color values."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/palettereference","title":"Palette Reference"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/Focusable":{"title":"Focusable","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/focusable","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Focusable"}],"type":"topic","kind":"